# Configs & tooling

- Edit existing files under `src/configs/` in place.
- Do not add duplicate root-level `vite.config.*`, `vitest.config.*`,
  `playwright.config.*`, or `eslint.config.*`.
- Root `tsconfig.json` should continue to **reference** the split configs
  (`tsconfig.app.json`, `tsconfig.node.json`, etc.), not replace them.

```text
❌ BAD: new eslint.config.js at repo root
✅ GOOD: edit src/configs/eslint.config.js
```
